# Template. The real shorebird.yaml is generated per control-plane instance,
# because app_id is server-generated (POST /api/v1/apps ignores a requested id).
#
# auto_update: false for the same reason manual_api_app needs it, plus one that
# is specific to G6: if the runtime may apply a patch on its own, the device
# could acquire BETA's patch without any Dart call having asked for beta, and
# the whole track-selection reading collapses. Every patch that lands here must
# be one this app explicitly requested, by name.
#
# NOTE the thing that is NOT here: `channel`. compileShorebirdYaml never copies
# it (shorebird_yaml.dart:68-70), so the updater falls back to
# DEFAULT_CHANNEL = "stable" (config.rs:24, :148). That is the product gap this
# fixture works around rather than hides -- the track is chosen per CALL from
# Dart, never by configuration.
app_id: REPLACE-ME
auto_update: false
base_url: http://localhost:18081
